{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-npc-p13432","chapterId":"sef968e536daaa01f","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-npc-p13432-df7e2b9c9423bf36c37b","entryId":"other-npc-p13432","chapterId":"sef968e536daaa01f","text":"오늘은 반드시 탈출할 것 같은 예감이 들어!","speaker":"시라토리","mission":"시라토리","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["16787874125389669351"],"speakerHashCandidates":["219305651478392678","18425062204987379651"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13432-86f818ded94fb6c57f9f","entryId":"other-npc-p13432","chapterId":"sef968e536daaa01f","text":"내가 역사의 증인이 되는 건가?","speaker":"","mission":"시라토리","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["12662910760416017551"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13432-457fded3c994a1589cce","entryId":"other-npc-p13432","chapterId":"sef968e536daaa01f","text":"헛수고하지 마","speaker":"","mission":"시라토리","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["11556215269325261632"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13432-1afc1de2e88eb6a52cc9","entryId":"other-npc-p13432","chapterId":"sef968e536daaa01f","text":"보는 눈 없는 죄수들처럼 무시하는 말만 하네. 두고 봐. 무수히 많은 밤낮을 거쳐 준비했으니 절대 실패 안 할 거라고","speaker":"시라토리","mission":"시라토리","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["6330670674965972477"],"speakerHashCandidates":["219305651478392678","18425062204987379651"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13432-784356b4003011bd4926","entryId":"other-npc-p13432","chapterId":"sef968e536daaa01f","text":"포기해. 밖엔 금 조각상 병사가 한 가득이야","speaker":"","mission":"시라토리","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["13308957649626946366"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13432-2268e10f73f36c99bb01","entryId":"other-npc-p13432","chapterId":"sef968e536daaa01f","text":"저 쇳덩이 두뇌들이 내 총명한 두뇌를 이길 거라고 생각하는 건 아니지? 저 멍청한 금 조각상들의 행동 패턴은 이미 다 파악했다고","speaker":"시라토리","mission":"시라토리","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["13629987194694698449"],"speakerHashCandidates":["219305651478392678","18425062204987379651"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13432-99da305b0ad2a25755aa","entryId":"other-npc-p13432","chapterId":"sef968e536daaa01f","text":"시라토리가 날개를 퍼덕이며 조작한다……","speaker":"","mission":"시라토리","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"narration","textHashCandidates":["14801446318215482334"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13432-f73bc77134196cf2d640","entryId":"other-npc-p13432","chapterId":"sef968e536daaa01f","text":"아야야… 또 실패했네. 어떻게 된 거지. 벌써 1,381번째 실패야","speaker":"시라토리","mission":"시라토리","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["10995182884301742996"],"speakerHashCandidates":["219305651478392678","18425062204987379651"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13432-876d3472fe3eba2c2af4","entryId":"other-npc-p13432","chapterId":"sef968e536daaa01f","text":"흑흑흑… 이제 아무 문제도 없을 줄 알았는데 대체 어디가 잘못된 거지?","speaker":"시라토리","mission":"시라토리","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["5893062821113882358"],"speakerHashCandidates":["219305651478392678","18425062204987379651"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13432-84ae1e6e6786ffe8a743","entryId":"other-npc-p13432","chapterId":"sef968e536daaa01f","text":"괜찮아…?","speaker":"","mission":"시라토리","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["3880252953473692255"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13432-09d3d2243a07813bc8ec","entryId":"other-npc-p13432","chapterId":"sef968e536daaa01f","text":"아하하하… 재밌어. 유폐옥은 정말 짜릿해. 감옥이 이래야지. 전에 갇혀본 감옥들은 시장통이나 다름없었는데","speaker":"시라토리","mission":"시라토리","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["2095329157873994442"],"speakerHashCandidates":["219305651478392678","18425062204987379651"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13432-e2ace5bebf905a166f59","entryId":"other-npc-p13432","chapterId":"sef968e536daaa01f","text":"뭐가 문제인지 알겠어. 방법만 살짝 개선하면 돼. 일단 이렇게 하고 그다음엔 이렇게 하면… 다음엔 분명 성공할 거야!","speaker":"시라토리","mission":"시라토리","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["16780571973434185132"],"speakerHashCandidates":["219305651478392678","18425062204987379651"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13432-e871a205eaf00477a17d","entryId":"other-npc-p13432","chapterId":"sef968e536daaa01f","text":"괜찮은 것 같네","speaker":"","mission":"시라토리","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["11785156665479305869"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13432-3e9c9af43aa74aabfcef","entryId":"other-npc-p13432","chapterId":"sef968e536daaa01f","text":"괜찮고 말고. 난 아주 잘 지내고 있어. 내가 지금 뚫으려는 곳이 전 은하에서 가장 복잡한 감옥이라는 사실만 떠올려도 전신의 투지가 불타올라","speaker":"시라토리","mission":"시라토리","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["7471453712141424594"],"speakerHashCandidates":["219305651478392678","18425062204987379651"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13432-ae27bc68014bb5fd0602","entryId":"other-npc-p13432","chapterId":"sef968e536daaa01f","text":"이렇게 노골적으로 구는데 아무도 뭐라고 안 해?","speaker":"","mission":"시라토리","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["666789700163028811"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13432-3c0724fb7a69c7b848e1","entryId":"other-npc-p13432","chapterId":"sef968e536daaa01f","text":"저 간수들은 아무 신경도 안 써. 가끔은 일부러 날 놔두는 게 아닐까 싶을 정도로","speaker":"시라토리","mission":"시라토리","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["14240279389718687129"],"speakerHashCandidates":["219305651478392678","18425062204987379651"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13432-79bb9309877634032223","entryId":"other-npc-p13432","chapterId":"sef968e536daaa01f","text":"난 뭐든 부수려고 안달 난 위험 분자들이랑 다르게 기술파라고. 날갯짓 소리만 좀 클 뿐이지 아무런 위해도 가하지 않잖아","speaker":"시라토리","mission":"시라토리","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["747555477163705907"],"speakerHashCandidates":["219305651478392678","18425062204987379651"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13432-8764a2155311a5ffdce1","entryId":"other-npc-p13432","chapterId":"sef968e536daaa01f","text":"시왕사의 함정 아닐까?","speaker":"","mission":"시라토리","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["5329967784287434329"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13432-d960758c6085ae1cf8e6","entryId":"other-npc-p13432","chapterId":"sef968e536daaa01f","text":"함정이든 아니든 상관없어. 난 그저 장치와 수수께끼만 있으면 되거든. 인정하고 싶지 않지만 매번 날 골치 아프게 하는 걸 보면 시왕사는 정말 대단해","speaker":"시라토리","mission":"시라토리","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["16913300218832046135"],"speakerHashCandidates":["219305651478392678","18425062204987379651"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13432-741be460320aa5aed4a6","entryId":"other-npc-p13432","chapterId":"sef968e536daaa01f","text":"그나저나 지금은 좀 피곤하네. 좀 쉬었다가 다시 도전해야겠어","speaker":"시라토리","mission":"시라토리","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["5668654506283433644"],"speakerHashCandidates":["219305651478392678","18425062204987379651"],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"schema":"hsr-wiki-reading.v1","missions":[{"id":"npc-p13432","title":"시라토리","page":"白鸟","officialMissionIds":[]}],"occurrences":[{"id":"other-npc-p13432-df7e2b9c9423bf36c37b","rowId":"other-npc-p13432-df7e2b9c9423bf36c37b","missionId":"npc-p13432","mission":"시라토리","sceneId":"sef968e536daaa01f","scene":"NPC 대사 1","contextId":"wiki-context-a81864f10cf5fa1d4ad2a5e1","page":"白鸟","revision":44372,"location":[0,0],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":[],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-npc-p13432-86f818ded94fb6c57f9f","rowId":"other-npc-p13432-86f818ded94fb6c57f9f","missionId":"npc-p13432","mission":"시라토리","sceneId":"sef968e536daaa01f","scene":"NPC 대사 1","contextId":"wiki-context-dcef003c7c0ad7247e5dcfbd","page":"白鸟","revision":44372,"location":[0,2,"option",0,0],"conditions":[],"branch":["75d2d